# Impeccable

Design work uses **Impeccable** ([impeccable.style](https://impeccable.style/)).

## Location

Expected path (gitignored — not in the repo):

```
.cursor/skills/impeccable/
```

## If missing — download before designing

If `.cursor/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md` is absent, **install it immediately** (do not invent a substitute skill):

```bash
npx impeccable install --providers=cursor --scope=project
```

Then read `.cursor/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md` and follow it. Product/visual authority: root `PRODUCT.md`, `DESIGN.md`, and `.cortext/`.

See `.cortext/impeccable.md` for the full command map.
